<title>HONG KONG: HK 91-day bills average accepted yield 5.12 pct.</title>
<headline>HK 91-day bills average accepted yield 5.12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield of 91-day Exchange Fund bills at Tuesday's weekly tender was 5.12 percent, the Hong Kong Monetary Authority (HKMA) said.</p>
<p>This compares with three-month HIBOR of 5.5625 percent at 0334 GMT and the average accepted yield of 5.22 percent at the previous tender on September 10.</p>
<p>Bids for the HK$1.50 billion issue was HK$6.42 billion vs HK$5.93 billion.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6936</p>
</text>
